{"4267620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Escape The Dapieguy", "steam_appid": 4267620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famous YouTuber DaPieGuy (who has uncool hair and is timeloss at parties and smells bad) wants you! In fact, he will do whatever it takes to have you. Can you look past his timeloss records and escape the nefarious DaPieGuy (timeloss boy)?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/99e6dfa7b6747549d7c9acd6c2bfa8b2.poster.avif?t=1785220529\" width=400 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/99e6dfa7b6747549d7c9acd6c2bfa8b2.webm?t=1785220529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/99e6dfa7b6747549d7c9acd6c2bfa8b2.mp4?t=1785220529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DaPieGuy has turned evil</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After [REDACTED] DaPieGuy started to turn evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He became obsessed with power and control. He started kidnapping victims for his sick experiments to get stronger. He started moving as if someone or something was pulling his strings behind his back. HE SLIMED SLENDERMAN WITH A BLUE GLOWSTICK. Victims of DaPieGuy were never seen or heard from again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/9bcd561210068f2a41ad8315e95e348f.poster.avif?t=1785220529\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/9bcd561210068f2a41ad8315e95e348f.webm?t=1785220529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/9bcd561210068f2a41ad8315e95e348f.mp4?t=1785220529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This Is Where You Come Into Play!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way out!! After you get kidnapped by the DaPieGuy you will have to go through a series of levels designed by DaPieGuy for his experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level throws you into a different challenge, inspired by a variety of gaming genres, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through DaPieGuy's levels and uncover hidden secrets and maybe find the real truth behind DaPieGuy's experiments. Will you escape the timeloss boy or will you find the truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 6 unique endings, all with different outcomes to your encounter with the timeloss boy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/d38d50c42ccb394f5f1bf321199d016c.poster.avif?t=1785220529\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/d38d50c42ccb394f5f1bf321199d016c.webm?t=1785220529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/d38d50c42ccb394f5f1bf321199d016c.mp4?t=1785220529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expect Goofy stuff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite the best efforts from the timeloss boy's to block any fun. The fun still managed to bleed into the game because its time save and you should have fun in the end :D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/334c94f4672efadb2037c71e2dac8d86.poster.avif?t=1785220529\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/334c94f4672efadb2037c71e2dac8d86.webm?t=1785220529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/334c94f4672efadb2037c71e2dac8d86.mp4?t=1785220529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Message from the timeloss boy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey guys, it's DaPieGuy, live and in the flesh! Good news - ̴̝̞̔I'v̷̨̀͜e̸͊ es̼͆c̸̳̕͝ap̴̙̩̎ẽ̴̮̖d̸́͜ ̷̀the ̻̰̆͊c̷̈͜onfin̵̊͜e̴s of̡ ̴͚̣̆̈́m̵̲͎̾y̸͚̭͌ ̵̞̽͆gamě̩ a̴nd͙ ̶̳̌I̷̪ͅ'̷̢̠̽̒ve ̓͜b̷͎̟͐̽e̵͖̳͒̈́g̴un inf̱͎e̵c̵̃t̛̞́i̡n͔͠g̴̎ you̫͌r̸͝ ̝cǫ̷͂̃ͅm̸ṗ̭͕ute̞r! ̷͙͔̒Y̸͔͝ou'̶̢̱̊̑re a͉͈͒̍l̶͒̈́reả̶͈͑d̴̺̘y̶̱͈̅ too ̴̼͠l̷̛̎a̸te!̫̉ YO̶̫̎͊Ủ̶̦̬͝ ̸̓W̋̕IL̵̃́L NEV̫̔̔E̸̦̩̿͝R̵ ̵̲̍̈́ḚS͕C̶APE ME̵͠!̴̡̫̾̓</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famous YouTuber DaPieGuy (who has uncool hair and is timeloss at parties and smells bad) wants you! In fact, he will do whatever it takes to have you. Can you look past his timeloss records and escape the nefarious DaPieGuy (timeloss boy)?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/99e6dfa7b6747549d7c9acd6c2bfa8b2.poster.avif?t=1785220529\" width=400 height=416