graph\" >Puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through DaPieGuy's levels and uncover hidden secrets and maybe find the real truth behind DaPieGuy's experiments. Will you escape the timeloss boy or will you find the truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 6 unique endings, all with different outcomes to your encounter with the timeloss boy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/d38d50c42ccb394f5f1bf321199d016c.poster.avif?t=1785220529\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/d38d50c42ccb394f5f1bf321199d016c.webm?t=1785220529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/d38d50c42ccb394f5f1bf321199d016c.mp4?t=1785220529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expect Goofy stuff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite the best efforts from the timeloss boy's to block any fun. The fun still managed to bleed into the game because its time save and you should have fun in the end :D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/334c94f4672efadb2037c71e2dac8d86.poster.avif?t=1785220529\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/334c94f4672efadb2037c71e2dac8d86.webm?t=1785220529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/extras/334c94f4672efadb2037c71e2dac8d86.mp4?t=1785220529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Message from the timeloss boy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey guys, it's DaPieGuy, live and in the flesh! Good news - ̴̝̞̔I'v̷̨̀͜e̸͊ es̼͆c̸̳̕͝ap̴̙̩̎ẽ̴̮̖d̸́͜ ̷̀the ̻̰̆͊c̷̈͜onfin̵̊͜e̴s of̡ ̴͚̣̆̈́m̵̲͎̾y̸͚̭͌ ̵̞̽͆gamě̩ a̴nd͙ ̶̳̌I̷̪ͅ'̷̢̠̽̒ve ̓͜b̷͎̟͐̽e̵͖̳͒̈́g̴un inf̱͎e̵c̵̃t̛̞́i̡n͔͠g̴̎ you̫͌r̸͝ ̝cǫ̷͂̃ͅm̸ṗ̭͕ute̞r! ̷͙͔̒Y̸͔͝ou'̶̢̱̊̑re a͉͈͒̍l̶͒̈́reả̶͈͑d̴̺̘y̶̱͈̅ too ̴̼͠l̷̛̎a̸te!̫̉ YO̶̫̎͊Ủ̶̦̬͝ ̸̓W̋̕IL̵̃́L NEV̫̔̔E̸̦̩̿͝R̵ ̵̲̍̈́ḚS͕C̶APE ME̵͠!̴̡̫̾̓</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Escape the Dapieguy is a horror game focused around the youtuber DaPieGuyYT. You play as someone who used to watch him but decided not to after the local disappearances. Unfortunately you are the next victim.......", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/1d804efde1c415aae0bd8ffa98b835d1efc9875e/header.jpg?t=1785220529", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/0ce74924bede22818acd4b13f9d3d0b2f7fe1db5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785220529", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4267620/0ce74924bede22818acd4b13f9d3d0b2f7fe1db5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785220529", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3GHz 4-Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 or Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 17 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommende